WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Heavy Hazanshu flips toward Ryu.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.150
The heavy overhead connects as a Punish Counter.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.550
Back heavy punch connects after the overhead.

4
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.500
Serenity Stream light kick follows the stance entry.

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Medium Spinning Bird Kick ends the route.

6
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:05.550
Both characters recover after the stance route.
